  "title": "Instant Pot® Warm Lentil Salad with Dijon Vinaigrette",
  "description": "Loaded with veggies, this warm lentil salad is made in the Instant Pot®. The savory Dijon mustard vinaigrette provides a tart flavor that complements the lentils nicely.",
